SELECT ?item ?itemLabel
(CONCAT("\u007C {","{rfd links\u007C",strafter(str(?item), "entity/"),"\u007Cfrom [[Wikidata:Database reports/to delete/empty list items]]}","}") as ?del)
{
	?item wdt:P31 wd:Q13406463 .
	MINUS { ?sitelink schema:about ?item }
        MINUS { [] ?any ?item }
	SERVICE wikibase:label { bd:serviceParam wikibase:language "en,es,fr,sv,nl,pl,de,ru" }
}
ORDER BY ?item
